  "notes": [
    "PropBetEdge-owned mapping from the team abbreviation used in our held datasets to the Wikidata item for the FRANCHISE. It is curated by us, not taken from any provider, and is recorded with its own source id so no fact is ever attributed to a source that did not state it.",
    "Wikidata carries no NFL team abbreviation (P1813/P1449/P4144 are empty for these items, measured 2026-09-15), so this mapping cannot be derived automatically.",
    "The mapping is validated structurally, not trusted: 32 abbreviations must map to 32 distinct QIDs, and the resulting Wikidata conference/division membership must form 2 conferences x 4 divisions x 4 teams. A mis-mapping breaks that shape.",
    "Abbreviations follow the current-normalized codes in our held data (LA = Los Angeles Rams, LV = Las Vegas Raiders, WAS = Washington). Historical codes (OAK, SD, STL, LAR, WSH) are aliases of the same franchise and resolve through the franchise, never by rewriting a historical team identity."
  ],
